{
  "slug": "str-portfolio-managers",
  "name": "Morpho STR Portfolio Managers",
  "description": "Independent short-term rental and vacation rental management companies in the US (New England first, then the Southeast) that manage 10 to 75 active STR units, ideally 15 to 50. Third-party managers or owned-and-managed portfolios, full service: guest services, housekeeping coordination, homeowner services. Team of roughly 3 to 20. The buyer is the founder, owner, CEO or managing partner, secondarily the COO or director of operations. Does NOT qualify: individual Airbnb hosts or single-property owners, real estate sales-only brokerages, long-term-only property managers, software vendors, cleaning-only companies, national brands (Vacasa, Evolve, Casago, Vtrips, AvantStay, Sonder), and franchise locations (iTrip, Grand Welcome) unless the local owner clearly runs their own ops. Unit count must be verified from the website, a listing count, or a stated number.",
  "offer_context": "Morpho sells operational capacity: AI inquiry routing and guest comms, SOPs, automated owner reporting, direct booking infrastructure, so a founder can grow the portfolio without the admin growing at the same rate. Not 'AI' as a product.",
